 to any number of destinations."}],"references":{"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/TrackingFromViews":{"url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Give views the tracker the way each framework passes values down, and let modifiers and controls track what views do."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/TrackingFromViews","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Tracking from SwiftUI, UIKit and AppKit"},"doc://TrackerTesting/documentation/TrackerTesting":{"abstract":[{"text":"Run a test’s body with a fresh tracker and check the events it tracked, in order.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"TrackerTesting","url":"\/documentation\/trackertesting","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackerTesting\/documentation\/TrackerTesting","role":"collection"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Trackers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent."}]},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/SamplingEvents":{"url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/samplingevents","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Keep a seeded fraction of the events a tracker tracks, event by event or a whole session at once.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/SamplingEvents","role":"article","title":"Sampling Events"},"doc://PostHogEncoding/documentation/PostHogEncoding":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/posthogencoding","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"PostHogEncoding","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Send records to PostHog Cloud or a self-hosted PostHog through its batch capture API.